r-cardinal</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M,\\theta,\\vec M\\in V\">\\(M,\\theta,\\vec M\\in V\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Function}:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{Function}:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"58-df-function\">58-df-function</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"|{-}|\">\\(|{-}|\\)</span> is the cardinality operator (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"2be08d4ee8aa1590\" href=\"?note=2be08d4ee8aa1590\" title=\"58-df-cardinality\">58-df-cardinality</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{LimitOrdinal}_S:V\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{LimitOrdinal}_S:V\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"81cabbac7fa4d75d\" href=\"?note=81cabbac7fa4d75d\" title=\"58-df-limitordinal\">58-df-limitordinal</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{RegularCardinal}_S:V\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{RegularCardinal}_S:V\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"0fbfc19800246e77\" href=\"?note=0fbfc19800246e77\" title=\"58-df-regular-cardinal\">58-df-regular-cardinal</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcLargecard4InternalApproachability}_S:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcLargecard4InternalApproachability}_S:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span></li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}largecard4\\text{-}internal\\text{-}approachability}\\vdash\n\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\mathrm{ZfcLargecard4InternalApproachability}_S(M,\\theta)\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{RegularCardinal}_S(\\theta)\\land |M|=\\theta\\land\\exists\\vec M\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{Function}(\\vec M,\\theta,\\mathcal P(M))\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\land M=\\bigcup_{\\alpha\\in\\theta}\\vec M(\\alpha)\n\\land\\forall\\alpha\\in\\theta\\;(|\\vec M(\\alpha)|&lt;\\theta)\n\\land\\forall\\beta\\in\\theta\\;\\forall\\alpha\\in\\beta\\;(\\vec M(\\alpha)\\subseteq\\vec M(\\beta))\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\land\\forall\\lambda\\in\\theta\\;\n(\\mathrm{LimitOrdinal}_S(\\lambda)\\to\n\\vec M(\\lambda)=\\bigcup_{\\alpha\\in\\lambda}\\vec M(\\alpha))\n\\land\\forall\\beta\\in\\theta\\;\n(\\beta+1\\in\\theta\\to\n\\vec M\\upharpoonright(\\beta+1)\\in\\vec M(\\beta+1))\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}largecard4\\text{-}internal\\text{-}approachability}\\vdash\n\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\mathrm{ZfcLargecard4InternalApproachability}_S(M,\\theta)\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{RegularCardinal}_S(\\theta)\\land |M|=\\theta\\land\\exists\\vec M\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{Function}(\\vec M,\\theta,\\mathcal P(M))\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\land M=\\bigcup_{\\alpha\\in\\theta}\\vec M(\\alpha)\n\\land\\forall\\alpha\\in\\theta\\;(|\\vec M(\\alpha)|&lt;\\theta)\n\\land\\forall\\beta\\in\\theta\\;\\forall\\alpha\\in\\beta\\;(\\vec M(\\alpha)\\subseteq\\vec M(\\beta))\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\land\\forall\\lambda\\in\\theta\\;\n(\\mathrm{LimitOrdinal}_S(\\lambda)\\to\n\\vec M(\\lambda)=\\bigcup_{\\alpha\\in\\lambda}\\vec M(\\alpha))\n\\land\\forall\\beta\\in\\theta\\;\n(\\beta+1\\in\\theta\\to\n\\vec M\\upharpoonright(\\beta+1)\\in\\vec M(\\beta+1))\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The carrier has the declared size <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\theta\">\\(\\theta\\)</span>. The witnessing chain is a genuine function into <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal P(M)\">\\(\\mathcal P(M)\\)</span>, is small, increasing and continuous at limit stages, and records each available initial segment at the following stage.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-df-cardinality","status":"resolved","id":"2be08d4ee8aa1590","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-cardinality]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-function","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-function]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-limitordinal","status":"resolved","id":"81cabbac7fa4d75d","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-limitordinal]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-powerset","status":"resolved","id":"2b6b1d9eb78a2714","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-powerset]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-regular-cardinal","status":"resolved","id":"0fbfc19800246e77","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-regular-cardinal]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-function","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Function}:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}$ (see [[58-df-function]])","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-cardinality","status":"resolved","id":"2be08d4ee8aa1590","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$|{-}|$ is the cardinality operator (see [[58-df-cardinality]])","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-limitordinal","status":"resolved","id":"81cabbac7fa4d75d","anchor":"ref-8","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{LimitOrdinal}_S:V\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}$ (see [[58-df-limitordinal]])","embed":false},